<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carriage Services.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carriage Services.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wasserstein Perella Securities said it initiated coverage of Carriage Services Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $28.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 at 21-1/2.</p>
